            <ArticleTitle>Report from the ASHP Midyear Clinical Meeting.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>61-73</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The American Society of Health-System Pharmacists 2003 annual Midyear Clinical meeting in December 2003 was attended by nearly 18,000 individuals and had increased content and networking opportunities of Pharmacists involved in pain management. Initiatives, awards and services presented and announced at the meeting are described.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
